  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inception Phase of Cooperation between Swedish and Albania Tax Authority</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inception Phase of cooperation between Swedish and Albanian Tax Authorities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skatteverket (SKV) har &#xf6;verl&#xe4;mnat ett projektf&#xf6;rslag till ambassaden i Tirana f&#xf6;r en inledningsfas  av samarbete mellan SKV och Generaldirektoratet f&#xf6;r skatter (GDT) Albanien. Projektet genomf&#xf6;rs som uppf&#xf6;ljning till den redan genomf&#xf6;rda f&#xf6;rberedelsefasen. Under f&#xf6;rberedelsefasen identifierades n&#xe5;gra prelimin&#xe4;ra omr&#xe5;den f&#xf6;r vidare dialog och peer to peer-utbyte under inledningsfasen. Detta f&#xf6;r att bed&#xf6;ma behoven och utforma ett l&#xe5;ngsiktigt samarbete</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish Tax Agency (STA) has submitted to the Embassy in Tirana a project proposal for an Inception Phase of Cooperation between the STA and General Directorate of Taxes (GDT) Albania. The proposal follows the fact- finding phase. During the fact finding  phase some preliminary areas were  identified  for further dialogue and peer to peer exchanges in the inception phase to assess the needs and design of the longer-term cooperation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention intends to assess in more details the needs of the General Directorate of Taxes (GDT) Albania in capacity building in areas already identified in the fact-finding mission or propose new areas for cooperation possible for STA to support. 
The objectives for the Inception Phase are to:
- Establish a Project Management structure for a future development project and start up activities within the prioritized areas
- Establish the experts from the STA and GDT into well-functioning teams
- Produce a draft Project Proposal for a future development project.</narrative>
  </description>
